WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:39.190 --> 01:41.900
And now, the next queen shall be announced.

01:42.200 --> 01:45.770
Chocolat Meilleure. Vanilla Meinx. Forward.

01:46.600 --> 01:47.200
Yes.

01:47.970 --> 01:51.470
You two, you have worked very hard up to this point.

01:53.510 --> 01:55.140
The next queen is...

01:58.410 --> 02:00.210
Chocolat Meilleure.

02:08.290 --> 02:09.220
Me!?

02:09.990 --> 02:11.560
Congratulations, Chocolat.

02:13.390 --> 02:15.700
From this point forward, please
take care of the Magical World.

02:15.930 --> 02:16.530
Okay!

02:17.170 --> 02:19.200
Congratulations, Chocolat-chan!

02:19.200 --> 02:20.940
Thanks, Vanilla!

02:20.940 --> 02:23.870
I'll make sure that everyone has
a blast in the Magical World!

02:23.870 --> 02:25.640
I... I'm not having a blast!

02:26.670 --> 02:29.410
It hurts! Lemme go!

02:33.480 --> 02:35.350
That's harsh...

02:39.550 --> 02:40.890
A... A dream?

02:42.160 --> 02:44.760
The Dreamy Magical Teacups

02:49.130 --> 02:49.800
A dream?

02:50.160 --> 02:53.030
Yeah! I had a dream where I became queen.

02:55.000 --> 02:58.030
Even if it was a dream, having Chocolat
as the queen is unacceptable!

02:58.240 --> 02:59.540
What?!

02:59.840 --> 03:02.580
I'd like to see inside those dreams.

03:03.310 --> 03:06.010
Even then, Chocolat's violent, isn't she?

03:06.310 --> 03:07.810
Well excuse me.

03:09.020 --> 03:11.950
To look into your dreams sounds
like fun, Chocolat-chan.

03:12.320 --> 03:15.060
I'd also like to take a look inside your dreams.

03:15.290 --> 03:16.260
Tell me about it!

03:16.260 --> 03:19.960
To be able to look inside everyone else's
dreams sounds like it'd be a blast!

03:21.030 --> 03:22.730
It is a blast!

03:24.270 --> 03:26.770
Why don't we go into everyone's dream world?

03:28.200 --> 03:29.720
You're sayin' you can do that?

03:29.720 --> 03:31.470
You can!

03:31.470 --> 03:33.140
How can you see them?

03:33.140 --> 03:37.780
There's something in the Magical World shopping
catalogue that lets you see inside people's dreams.

03:38.050 --> 03:40.950
Really? Let's order it now!

03:40.950 --> 03:44.250
Wait a second! I'm not done yet!

03:44.850 --> 03:47.250
This thing will be able to help
you pick up more hearts.

03:48.760 --> 03:52.560
If you can look into people's dreams, you
can find out the kinds of things they like.

03:52.560 --> 03:57.300
If you approach them knowing how they feel,
they'll easily hand over their hearts!

03:57.730 --> 03:59.570
Ah! I get it!

03:59.570 --> 04:02.000
Duke, you're sometimes actually pretty useful!

04:03.070 --> 04:06.540
Naturally. I'm always a nice guy.

04:08.280 --> 04:10.180
Now this I gotta see.

04:11.780 --> 04:13.210
There! That's it!

04:13.920 --> 04:17.720
Lessee... "Dream Cup" 100 ecures each...

04:17.720 --> 04:19.450
Not as expensive as I thought.

04:19.890 --> 04:20.690
You're right.

04:21.020 --> 04:22.420
Let's order!

04:22.660 --> 04:27.390
One, two, three, four, five, six!

04:27.930 --> 04:29.400
Sugar Sugar Rune!

04:40.410 --> 04:43.110
How ya'll doing? I'm from the Magical
World Mail Order Catalogue.

04:43.110 --> 04:43.800
Hi!

04:44.510 --> 04:47.610
Thank ya'll. Lemme remind ya...

04:47.920 --> 04:49.560
Here's the Dream Cup you ordered.

04:49.560 --> 04:51.220
Please handle with care.

04:53.150 --> 04:56.360
There's a thin line between the real
world and the dream world.

04:56.790 --> 05:01.400
Dreams can be very fun sometimes,
but also sad and painful.

05:01.930 --> 05:04.570
If you get too deeply inside, it's gonna hurt'cha.

05:04.570 --> 05:06.470
Oh, it'll be fine!

05:06.700 --> 05:07.700
Thanks again.

05:08.200 --> 05:11.200
I'll be waiting for your next order!

05:11.910 --> 05:15.080
Alright, with this I can see into everyone's dreams!

05:17.950 --> 05:19.650
So this is the Dream Cup.

05:20.150 --> 05:21.670
Alright, it's done.

05:21.950 --> 05:22.980
Now, for starters...

05:23.320 --> 05:25.890
Chocolat-chan, let me drink from it.

05:27.390 --> 05:31.640
Being able to have fun with Chocolat-chan
in my dreams would be wonderful, I think!

05:32.490 --> 05:33.690
So, I'm going to drink, okay?

05:36.460 --> 05:37.900
Mmm! It's tasty!

05:50.510 --> 05:51.380
Finished!

05:53.610 --> 05:54.410
Cool!

05:55.280 --> 05:58.590
Chocolat-chan! Good thing
you're here. Shall we eat?

05:59.720 --> 06:01.520
Bon appetit!

06:04.130 --> 06:05.660
Delicious!

06:05.660 --> 06:08.730
Vanilla's homemade cakes are always fantastic!

06:08.730 --> 06:11.100
Really? Thank you, Chocolat-chan.

06:11.730 --> 06:14.100
Vanilla's cake is really yummy.

06:14.700 --> 06:17.270
You can really tell she put her heart into it.

06:21.840 --> 06:24.110
Huh? Didn't you see anything?

06:24.110 --> 06:26.210
I was in your dream just now.

06:27.120 --> 06:30.480
Your homemade decorated cake was SUPER tasty!

06:30.480 --> 06:32.150
You don't say?

06:32.150 --> 06:34.390
I had that dream just the other day.

06:35.460 --> 06:39.990
So you get into the dream of whoever
drinks out of this teacup instantly...

06:41.460 --> 06:42.560
Well then, next up...

06:43.030 --> 06:43.500
Duke.

06:43.500 --> 06:44.770
Take a little sip.

06:45.630 --> 06:47.270
I'm just fine!

06:47.270 --> 06:48.740
It's fine, already!

06:49.140 --> 06:50.640
S-s-stop!

06:55.180 --> 06:57.640
It's tough being such a popular guy...

07:00.820 --> 07:03.080
I... I shouldn't have seen that.

07:03.080 --> 07:05.190
I told you so!

07:06.390 --> 07:07.680
Are you guys there?

07:07.920 --> 07:09.320
Houx! Saule!

07:09.320 --> 07:10.390
What are you up to?

07:10.930 --> 07:12.210
Oh! Is it tea time?

07:12.860 --> 07:14.730
I'm really thirsty, too.

07:15.860 --> 07:16.830
Lemme take a sip.

07:17.270 --> 07:18.300
Th-that's...!

07:27.010 --> 07:29.580
Wh-what's this? Whose wedding is this?!

07:29.840 --> 07:30.480
Chocolat.

07:31.280 --> 07:33.110
We're finally getting married.

07:34.950 --> 07:35.580
Saule!

07:36.880 --> 07:39.150
Then, this is my wedding?!

07:39.390 --> 07:41.920
You may now kiss the bride.

07:42.160 --> 07:42.790
Chocolat.

07:43.860 --> 07:44.890
Wa-wai-wait!

07:45.590 --> 07:46.890
Wait right there!

07:48.030 --> 07:49.440
I won't let you have Chocolat!

07:49.760 --> 07:50.670
Houx!

07:50.670 --> 07:52.470
This is Chocolat's and my wedding!

07:52.470 --> 07:55.440
You're wrong!
Chocolat is going to marry me!

07:55.870 --> 07:59.010
Who's she gonna marry then?
Let's ask Chocolat herself.

08:00.140 --> 08:00.910
Chocolat!

08:01.840 --> 08:04.010
Just which one of us are you going to marry?

08:10.950 --> 08:12.690
Isn't that a Dream Cup?

08:13.290 --> 08:13.990
You're right!

08:14.490 --> 08:15.620
Then, Chocolat...

08:15.620 --> 08:17.860
You just looked inside one of my dreams.

08:21.030 --> 08:22.230
What's wrong, Saule?

08:23.100 --> 08:24.970
Nothing at...all.

08:26.270 --> 08:29.140
Whattaya think, Chocolat?
Isn't the Dream World fun?

08:29.540 --> 08:30.240
Yeah!

08:30.240 --> 08:33.770
I can't wait to try it on everyone in class
and take a look inside their dreams!

08:33.770 --> 08:35.080
Everyone in class?!

08:35.080 --> 08:36.840
Are you planning to look into
the dreams of the girls, too?!

08:37.110 --> 08:39.030
Yeah, it'll be fun!

08:39.650 --> 08:42.320
Have you not forgotten our original objective?

08:42.480 --> 08:46.750
Hey, I was going to put up an outdoor cafe in front of the school grounds. Whattaya think?

08:47.090 --> 08:48.220
Outdoor cafe?

08:48.460 --> 08:51.690
Yeah, and I was going to put out this teacup.

08:51.960 --> 08:57.000
That sounds great! I'll make some cakes
to serve with the tea, Chocolat-chan!

08:57.470 --> 09:00.000
And I can be a cute waitress!

09:00.770 --> 09:02.040
That, my dear--

09:03.170 --> 09:07.810
Once they see Vanilla-chama dressed as a
waitress, all the boys will get all mushy!

09:08.110 --> 09:09.080
Oh, Blanca...

09:09.210 --> 09:11.210
Well then, it's decided.

09:11.210 --> 09:12.380
Houx. Saule.

09:12.380 --> 09:14.480
You two will help out with this too, okay?

09:14.480 --> 09:15.820
Sounds like fun.

09:16.250 --> 09:18.310
Anything to help you out, Chocolat.

09:19.090 --> 09:21.560
It's settled then! This'll be great!

09:22.960 --> 09:26.290
Once again, Chocolat starts something
that I've got a bad feeling about.

09:33.300 --> 09:34.300
Let's go, Vanilla!

09:36.070 --> 09:38.510
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

09:46.750 --> 09:47.380
Wand!

09:57.690 --> 09:58.730
Alright!

10:00.700 --> 10:04.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

10:06.430 --> 10:07.270
Wand!

10:07.870 --> 10:10.440
Become an outdoor cafe!

10:16.080 --> 10:17.940
And we'll also transform!

10:18.410 --> 10:19.080
Huh?

10:19.580 --> 10:21.780
The courtyards now a cafe!

10:22.420 --> 10:24.780
Hi there! Welcome!

10:24.920 --> 10:25.820
Chocolat.

10:26.490 --> 10:29.190
Today's a one-time only event, Chocolat Cafe!

10:29.690 --> 10:30.990
Chocolat Cafe?

10:31.360 --> 10:32.230
Welcome!

10:33.630 --> 10:34.930
Welcome, ladies.

10:34.930 --> 10:36.500
Please enjoy yourselves.

10:36.500 --> 10:38.200
Okay!

10:38.500 --> 10:39.430
Huh?

10:39.430 --> 10:40.660
What is this?

10:41.240 --> 10:42.620
Welcome!

10:42.840 --> 10:43.800
It's Ice.

10:44.470 --> 10:48.580
This cake. It might not suit your tastes, but...

10:49.540 --> 10:50.680
Please try some!

10:51.780 --> 10:53.250
Of course I'll eat it!

10:53.250 --> 10:54.910
Me too!

10:54.920 --> 10:56.920
I'll eat all of Vanilla-chan's cakes!

10:56.920 --> 10:58.180
Please, help yourself!

10:58.190 --> 11:00.190
Welcome to Chocolat Cafe!

11:25.510 --> 11:27.710
Vanilla-chan, so cute!

11:29.250 --> 11:30.680
Yay! Hearts!

11:31.050 --> 11:32.590
Vanilla-chama, now!

11:32.920 --> 11:35.960
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

11:36.190 --> 11:37.060
Wand!

11:37.890 --> 11:40.060
Hearts, hearts, please come to me!

11:48.100 --> 11:49.200
Vanilla, you're quick!

11:50.600 --> 11:52.170
Don't lose to her, Chocolat!

11:52.870 --> 11:54.610
That's right. I gotta look into everyone's dreams!

12:06.850 --> 12:08.350
I knew it, a UFO!

12:08.350 --> 12:10.960
Aliens really do exist!

12:11.730 --> 12:13.930
I didn't have to see his dream to know this.

12:14.300 --> 12:15.730
Let's take a look at who's next!

12:22.670 --> 12:25.510
I shall retire from singing today!

12:25.510 --> 12:27.570
I have found an even greater love!

12:28.580 --> 12:29.380
Akane!

12:32.450 --> 12:33.650
Robin-sama!

12:36.820 --> 12:39.290
Eh? This is what Akane dreams about?

12:39.620 --> 12:40.770
Akane!

12:40.770 --> 12:43.060
Robin-sama!

12:46.430 --> 12:48.460
There is nothing that will pull us apart.

12:48.830 --> 12:52.170
Let's enjoy a simple, happy life from now on.

12:52.770 --> 12:54.480
Ah! Robin-sama!

12:54.870 --> 12:58.440
Aw! So Akane loves Robin!

12:58.440 --> 13:02.110
This kind of info is worthless to me!

13:02.110 --> 13:03.040
Next, next!

13:03.840 --> 13:04.680
Take that!

13:05.480 --> 13:07.950
Mimura wants to be a soccer player, huh!

13:09.180 --> 13:10.380
Cute!

13:10.850 --> 13:13.150
Eh. Natume's into this type of thing?

13:13.620 --> 13:14.990
Marry me, please!

13:15.260 --> 13:18.290
Kitajima likes someone with glasses like him!

13:18.760 --> 13:20.360
This might be useful!

13:21.830 --> 13:23.000
Hey, hey, Kitajima!

13:23.000 --> 13:24.160
Eh? What?

13:25.070 --> 13:26.130
How do they look?

13:31.310 --> 13:34.010
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

13:34.610 --> 13:39.950
Your heart... Pick up!

13:50.190 --> 13:52.030
What the? Pee-colored?

13:52.030 --> 13:53.230
You just startled him.

13:53.760 --> 13:55.660
Things aren't always that easy.

13:55.660 --> 13:57.530
I'm not done yet, okay?!

13:58.030 --> 14:00.070
Welcome to Chocolat Cafe!

14:02.300 --> 14:03.990
Thanks for the food!

14:04.170 --> 14:05.140
Later!

14:07.670 --> 14:09.240
Man, I'm beat.

14:09.240 --> 14:10.130
Chocolat-chan!

14:11.180 --> 14:12.510
Everyone else went home.

14:12.980 --> 14:14.610
Huh? Where're Houx and Saule?

14:15.320 --> 14:17.220
They went grocery shopping for dinner.

14:18.020 --> 14:19.690
How'd it go? The Dream Cup.

14:20.090 --> 14:21.520
It didn't help at all.

14:22.360 --> 14:22.760
Hey.

14:27.430 --> 14:28.360
Pierre.

14:28.830 --> 14:31.160
I saw the two of you from the library.

14:32.200 --> 14:34.940
Any chance I could have something to drink?

14:35.170 --> 14:37.840
Uh, I'm afraid we are closing now.

14:37.840 --> 14:38.570
Sure.

14:38.570 --> 14:39.640
Chocolat-chan.

14:40.510 --> 14:42.180
The tea has gotten cold.

14:42.580 --> 14:43.680
That's just how I like it.

14:46.030 --> 14:48.030
Vanilla, I've got it.

14:48.580 --> 14:50.350
Chocolat-chan, that's...

14:52.920 --> 14:57.760
If I look inside one of his dreams, I might be
able to figure out how to take Pierre's heart.

15:04.330 --> 15:05.600
Well then, here I go.

15:07.300 --> 15:08.400
Alright!

15:16.280 --> 15:16.940
This is...

15:18.750 --> 15:20.980
This is inside Pierre's dream.

15:23.350 --> 15:23.920
Chocolat.

15:26.720 --> 15:27.450
Pierre.

15:27.960 --> 15:29.320
What are you doing here?

15:30.690 --> 15:32.330
I had a feeling you'd be here.

15:34.430 --> 15:35.830
I'm glad you came here.

15:37.700 --> 15:39.470
It's boring being here alone.

15:40.500 --> 15:42.270
Pierre. He looks lonely.

15:43.370 --> 15:44.900
It's no good having you like that.

15:50.380 --> 15:51.540
Was that magic just now?

15:52.250 --> 15:53.550
Hurry over here.

15:53.550 --> 15:54.610
It feels nice.

15:57.550 --> 15:58.120
Wait!

16:07.190 --> 16:09.260
It's okay. Just leave it to me.

16:11.300 --> 16:16.240
That's right. This is inside Pierre's
dream, so anything can happen.

16:20.980 --> 16:22.840
How is it? Feels nice, doesn't it?

16:23.410 --> 16:25.450
Yeah. I guess.

16:26.880 --> 16:29.350
This is inside Pierre's dream...

16:30.990 --> 16:34.560
What is it... He looks so different
from how he usually looks.

16:39.890 --> 16:42.600
Here you go. I warmed up your cup for you.

16:44.200 --> 16:47.670
I can really relax when I'm with you.

16:52.570 --> 16:54.810
By myself... it's lonely.

16:55.780 --> 16:57.040
Lonely?

17:00.750 --> 17:03.520
Aren't Yurika and the members
somewhere around here?

17:04.120 --> 17:06.620
Yurika? Members, what's that?

17:08.160 --> 17:09.790
I am the only person that's here.

17:10.960 --> 17:11.290
No.

17:12.130 --> 17:13.730
You're here too.

17:21.600 --> 17:22.100
Take that!

17:22.900 --> 17:24.300
Why, you!

17:24.300 --> 17:24.640
And that!

17:28.880 --> 17:29.580
That!

17:29.580 --> 17:30.140
Cold!

17:33.780 --> 17:36.550
Pierre, you sneak! You..!

17:39.550 --> 17:40.490
Yes!

17:44.290 --> 17:46.000
Pierre, you okay?

17:49.480 --> 17:50.380
Pierre...

17:58.540 --> 17:59.710
I'll whup your butt!

18:19.430 --> 18:20.130
It's cold!

18:20.890 --> 18:22.500
I should get going.

18:24.470 --> 18:28.630
Going into Pierre's dream was
more fun than I expected.

18:29.370 --> 18:32.210
Farewell, Pierre-inside-the-dream...

18:35.140 --> 18:35.610
Huh?

18:37.040 --> 18:39.210
Alright. Okay!

18:42.520 --> 18:45.250
What's wrong? I can't go back!

18:46.520 --> 18:47.250
What's wrong?

18:48.660 --> 18:51.020
I was just thinking I should be heading back...

18:51.460 --> 18:52.090
You can't.

18:55.300 --> 18:56.900
I want you to stay here.

18:58.970 --> 19:00.800
I told you, it's lonely being alone here.

19:01.870 --> 19:05.070
Here, with you, I can always stay here together.

19:08.980 --> 19:11.310
You can stay, right. Here, morever.

19:18.220 --> 19:20.590
Is this really Pierre's dream?

19:21.360 --> 19:24.690
Is he really thinking that he wants to be with me?

19:25.930 --> 19:29.160
Are those Pierre's true feelings?

19:32.770 --> 19:36.200
I understand. You don't want to stay with me, huh?

19:37.100 --> 19:39.210
Well, I'll leave you alone, then.

19:43.380 --> 19:48.110
Pierre? Where did you go, Pierre? Pierre!

19:51.190 --> 19:54.350
Pierre! Don't leave me alone!

19:56.560 --> 19:57.990
Come back...

19:59.090 --> 19:59.930
What's wrong?

20:07.470 --> 20:08.430
Pierre.

20:09.440 --> 20:12.440
So? It was lonely being alone, wasn't it?

20:13.140 --> 20:14.040
That was mean!

20:15.010 --> 20:17.080
Then I will stay with you.

20:17.810 --> 20:20.310
For all time, always.

20:24.520 --> 20:25.480
Chocolat!

20:50.980 --> 20:51.910
This is...

20:52.150 --> 20:54.710
Chocolat-chan! Thank goodness!

20:55.550 --> 20:56.920
Are you all right, Chocolat?

21:03.790 --> 21:04.660
I've come back.

21:05.330 --> 21:07.530
I was able to get out of Pierre's dream.

21:08.000 --> 21:09.360
That was dangerous.

21:10.400 --> 21:12.670
You almost got caught in his dream.

21:13.600 --> 21:16.240
Into a timeless, eternal dream.

21:17.070 --> 21:17.940
Where's Pierre?

21:18.370 --> 21:23.720
I went to go get him some cake, and
when I returned, he was gone.

21:24.180 --> 21:27.910
Chocolat, you better keep a
safe distance from Pierre.

21:29.950 --> 21:32.780
That guy smells of the Magical World.

21:38.730 --> 21:41.730
Hey, Vanilla. Just what is a "dream"?

21:43.900 --> 21:48.080
A dream can be something fun, something pretty,

21:48.080 --> 21:50.970
but you can also have sad and painful dreams, too.

21:51.540 --> 21:53.240
Sad and painful dreams?

21:55.140 --> 21:57.380
By myself... It's lonely.

21:58.580 --> 22:03.020
The Pierre inside the dream... is still there, isn't he?

22:23.120 --> 22:29.450
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.540 --> 22:30.950
"Love"

22:31.860 --> 22:35.370
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.780
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.210 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.960 --> 23:00.230
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.830 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.200 --> 23:11.270
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.640 --> 23:16.080
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.080 --> 23:26.190
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.250 --> 23:35.160
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.050 --> 23:49.170
A great way to collect hearts without fail...

23:49.170 --> 23:52.470
Operation Codename: The Aiming Cupid!

23:52.470 --> 23:56.090
My next target is a model student 6th-grader named Shinohara-senpai!

23:56.090 --> 23:58.090
Senpai's heart is definitely going to be all mine!

23:58.670 --> 24:01.700
But, why is Vanilla always hanging around Senpai's side?!

24:01.700 --> 24:04.420
Eh?! He's also Vanilla's target?!

